WEBVTT

01:41.320 --> 01:45.950
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.670 --> 01:48.950
[Episode 17]

01:50.200 --> 01:51.200
You're the girl

01:51.479 --> 01:52.560
who came to visit me

01:52.770 --> 01:53.990
when I was in seclusion?

01:55.000 --> 01:55.590
Immortal Master,

01:55.789 --> 01:56.950
do you really have a way

01:57.039 --> 01:58.509
to return the spiritual soul to its soul owner?

01:59.400 --> 01:59.789
What?

02:00.280 --> 02:00.840
I don't look trustworthy?

02:02.120 --> 02:03.120
I was just suppressed by you

02:03.310 --> 02:04.310
because my Golden Core was damaged

02:04.330 --> 02:05.290
during my seclusion;

02:05.510 --> 02:06.510
I'm still low on spiritual energy.

02:06.970 --> 02:07.610
I was

02:07.640 --> 02:08.680
not this weak before.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.840
Actually, Immortal Master, the moment you made your move,

02:12.150 --> 02:12.910
I was just overwhelmed

02:12.910 --> 02:13.680
by your aura.

02:14.350 --> 02:15.810
As expected of the Master Healer of immortal cultivation.

02:15.860 --> 02:16.650
Truly impressive.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.800
The return of my spiritual soul friend

02:18.980 --> 02:20.420
all depends on you, Immortal Master.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.680
Do you know who

02:22.710 --> 02:23.470
the spiritual soul's owner is?

02:25.680 --> 02:26.360
Immortal Master,

02:26.820 --> 02:28.040
I bet you have a way

02:28.380 --> 02:29.650
to find out who the soul owner is, right?

02:30.710 --> 02:31.910
This spiritual soul's been protecting

02:32.190 --> 02:32.940
and helping me all the way.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.360
I also want to know

02:34.380 --> 02:35.790
who its owner really is.

02:36.470 --> 02:38.020
I wonder if the lack of the spiritual soul

02:38.079 --> 02:39.100
has had any effect on him.

02:39.960 --> 02:40.680
Of course,

02:40.710 --> 02:41.430
it'd have affected him.

02:41.670 --> 02:42.750
Those without spiritual souls

02:42.780 --> 02:43.700
can neither form Golden Cores

02:43.910 --> 02:44.630
nor advance in cultivation.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.270
Is it that serious?

02:46.960 --> 02:48.710
Then I must return the spiritual soul as soon as possible.

02:49.180 --> 02:50.090
Immortal Master Liang, you...

02:50.120 --> 02:50.750
What a pity.

02:51.079 --> 02:52.190
If you came to me

02:52.210 --> 02:52.780
before my seclusion,

02:53.079 --> 02:53.650
I could give it a try

02:53.680 --> 02:54.840
even for such a spiritual soul

02:55.079 --> 02:56.030
separated from its owner for so long,

02:56.870 --> 02:57.630
What about now?

02:57.960 --> 02:59.030
As I said before,

02:59.190 --> 03:00.140
my Golden Core is damaged.

03:00.190 --> 03:01.310
I can do nothing about it now.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.430
Immortal Master Liang,

03:04.030 --> 03:04.980
please help me.

03:05.150 --> 03:05.750
Alright, girl,

03:06.150 --> 03:06.870
don't bother begging me.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.430
The key to change

03:09.560 --> 03:10.680
depends on you.

03:11.360 --> 03:13.000
Having taken good care of a separated spiritual soul

03:13.020 --> 03:13.790
after all this time,

03:14.030 --> 03:15.520
you must be someone with a Formless Spirit Root,

03:15.840 --> 03:16.360
right?

03:18.470 --> 03:19.030
Don't be nervous.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.430
I just like

03:20.430 --> 03:21.560
studying spiritual souls.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.070
I'm not interested in others'

03:23.190 --> 03:24.000
Spirit Roots or artifacts.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.079
The ancient text says,

03:25.430 --> 03:26.310
when those with Formless Spirit Roots

03:26.560 --> 03:27.360
form Golden Cores,

03:27.520 --> 03:29.030
they can just send spiritual souls back to the owners.

03:29.680 --> 03:30.630
Which ancient text?

03:31.520 --> 03:33.120
I can't quite remember.

03:33.710 --> 03:34.150
However,

03:34.930 --> 03:36.210
I remember that this method

03:36.630 --> 03:37.960
comes with a price,

03:38.300 --> 03:39.050
a price that diminishes

03:39.079 --> 03:40.310
one's own cultivation.

03:41.150 --> 03:41.840
I'm afraid you won't

03:42.490 --> 03:43.120
be willing to pay it.

03:43.750 --> 03:44.579
One should repay a favor.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.470
I only want to be true to my conscience.

03:48.750 --> 03:49.470
Girl,

03:49.910 --> 03:51.520
I'm starting to grow on you.

03:56.510 --> 03:57.190
Master!

03:57.750 --> 03:59.430
Why did you bring this jinx here?

03:59.900 --> 04:00.550
I went to get the wine cups,

04:00.580 --> 04:01.660
and he followed me all the way here.

04:02.350 --> 04:03.830
What is this lightweight

04:04.030 --> 04:05.000
doing here at our drinking party?

04:05.960 --> 04:06.840
Master, please sit here.

04:07.330 --> 04:07.960
You can have some tea.

04:13.880 --> 04:15.640
Didn't expect someone as cold and aloof as you

04:15.910 --> 04:17.120
to show such an expression.

04:17.510 --> 04:18.800
You don't look like yourself.

04:20.310 --> 04:20.750
Ranran,

04:21.360 --> 04:22.270
just a heads-up.

04:22.600 --> 04:23.870
You'd better be careful with him.

04:24.430 --> 04:25.750
Don't be fooled by him.

04:28.510 --> 04:29.090
That's not true.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.390
My master's always been so nice.

04:31.360 --> 04:32.070
Immortal Master Liang,

04:32.360 --> 04:33.670
you knew my master before, right?

04:34.950 --> 04:35.480
We have a grudge.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.040
Mistaken Divine.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.950
I really miss this taste.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.700
Were it not for someone,

04:48.409 --> 04:49.920
I could be drinking with Qingge today,

04:49.950 --> 04:50.830
chatting

04:51.120 --> 04:52.120
and watching the moon together.

04:53.630 --> 04:54.510
Exactly.

04:55.190 --> 04:55.750
Well,

04:56.070 --> 04:57.600
Mu is good in every way,

04:57.830 --> 04:59.000
except for her poor judgment.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.240
She got such a

05:00.240 --> 05:01.360
heartless and ungrateful disciple

05:02.070 --> 05:03.050
who got her killed.

05:03.630 --> 05:04.920
My master did it for the greater good.

05:05.070 --> 05:05.700
Mu Qingge...

05:05.750 --> 05:06.430
Ridiculous!

05:06.630 --> 05:07.750
What kind of greater good was that?

05:08.240 --> 05:09.600
Eliminated the Demon's child to save the universe?

05:10.720 --> 05:12.160
Mu Qingge's definitely not the Demon's child!

05:12.870 --> 05:13.630
How could that be?

05:14.070 --> 05:14.600
Then who is it?

05:14.630 --> 05:15.630
Anyway, it must be someone else.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.120
Back then, Mu

05:17.560 --> 05:18.920
must have fallen for someone's scheme

05:19.510 --> 05:20.000
or what,

05:20.000 --> 05:21.190
so she was possessed by the Spirit Spring.

05:21.600 --> 05:22.510
If she were the Demon's child,

05:23.360 --> 05:25.190
why would she endure the pain of splitting her core?

05:25.850 --> 05:26.890
She didn't hesitate to use her Golden Core

05:26.920 --> 05:27.870
to envelope the Spirit Spring

05:27.890 --> 05:29.600
and extract it from her body.

05:30.130 --> 05:31.090
She just planned to send

05:31.120 --> 05:32.800
the Spirit Spring back to the netherworld at the very beginning.

05:34.310 --> 05:35.510
Then why...

05:35.750 --> 05:37.360
Because only after she went to the netherworld did she learn

05:37.560 --> 05:39.300
that only the Demon's child could seal the Spirit Spring.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.630
Qingge had no choice but to extract the Spirit Spring

05:42.830 --> 05:44.070
and seal it temporarily.

05:46.070 --> 05:46.950
Did she mention

05:47.120 --> 05:48.000
anything special she ran into

05:48.000 --> 05:48.630
in the netherworld?

05:52.780 --> 05:53.830
She didn't go into details.

05:54.720 --> 05:56.680
But before she went to the netherworld, she sent me a letter,

05:57.040 --> 05:58.240
asking me to make not only golden talismans

05:58.270 --> 05:59.630
to suppress the Spirit Spring

06:00.060 --> 06:01.210
but also several battle talismans

06:01.240 --> 06:02.750
to fight powerful beings.

06:03.830 --> 06:04.600
She said

06:04.720 --> 06:06.240
there might be a formidable enemy in the netherworld.

06:06.950 --> 06:08.030
At that time, she still had her Golden Core

06:08.360 --> 06:09.270
with few who could match her.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.160
Who exactly did she fight against

06:11.480 --> 06:12.480
in the netherworld?

06:13.430 --> 06:13.830
Also,

06:14.070 --> 06:15.070
who exactly was her opponent?

06:16.270 --> 06:17.360
You're asking me?

06:19.920 --> 06:21.430
I didn't even have time to ask Mu

06:21.720 --> 06:23.950
before she perished in the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.040
Su Yishui,

06:32.750 --> 06:33.720
let's be real.

06:34.390 --> 06:36.240
When you accused Mu Qingge of being the Demon's child

06:36.270 --> 06:37.240
and launched an attack on her,

06:37.470 --> 06:38.720
did you really have solid evidence

06:38.750 --> 06:39.870
without considering any personal beef?

06:48.070 --> 06:48.510
What?

06:50.159 --> 06:51.190
Cat got your tongue?

06:57.240 --> 06:57.730
Ranran!

06:57.880 --> 06:58.720
Open your eyes!

06:58.870 --> 06:59.920
This man is neither kind

06:59.920 --> 07:00.560
nor honest.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.000
How can he be called sovereign?

07:06.280 --> 07:07.330
Instead of following this cruel

07:07.360 --> 07:08.190
and ungrateful master-killer,

07:08.950 --> 07:09.510
you'd be better

07:09.680 --> 07:10.900
just stay here with me on Mount Cuiwei!

07:11.430 --> 07:12.870
My master is not what you think.

07:14.120 --> 07:14.720
I have some questions

07:14.720 --> 07:15.630
about cultivation to ask my master.

07:15.750 --> 07:16.600
I'll take my leave now.

07:18.720 --> 07:19.190
Master.

07:38.430 --> 07:39.190
Master,

07:39.630 --> 07:41.190
what did the Alcohol Immortal mean?

07:41.600 --> 07:43.680
Is my grandmaster really the Demon's child?

07:44.040 --> 07:44.600
Of course...

07:48.690 --> 07:49.520
Silencing Curse?

07:49.750 --> 07:50.870
Master, what's wrong?

07:54.600 --> 07:55.870
Do you also think the real Demon's child

07:56.430 --> 07:57.390
deserves to die

07:57.720 --> 07:59.120
the most tragic death?

08:01.270 --> 08:02.160
But I don't understand.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.000
Without the Spirit Spring,

08:04.190 --> 08:05.160
wouldn't the Demon's child just be

08:05.190 --> 08:06.070
an ordinary person?

08:06.500 --> 08:08.310
He or she was just born at a special moment.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.750
Just a poor little thing

08:09.830 --> 08:11.960
born as a vessel

08:12.480 --> 08:14.160
with no choice.

08:15.000 --> 08:16.070
The real root of evil

08:16.310 --> 08:17.720
has always been the Spirit Spring.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.070
Perhaps my grandmaster

08:21.160 --> 08:22.430
thought the same way back then.

08:22.830 --> 08:23.720
That's why she willingly bore

08:23.750 --> 08:24.830
the stigma of being called the Demon's child

08:24.850 --> 08:26.220
and zeroed in on sealing the Spirit Spring

08:26.560 --> 08:28.040
to stop the fight between people and the Demon's child.

08:29.910 --> 08:31.560
Master, are you angry?

08:32.440 --> 08:33.960
I shouldn't have talked about my grandmaster like that.

08:34.440 --> 08:34.870
No,

08:35.960 --> 08:36.510
what you said

08:37.120 --> 08:38.030
is a real comfort.

08:40.480 --> 08:42.200
Just some random thoughts.

08:54.440 --> 08:56.090
What lovely thing has made you

08:56.120 --> 08:56.990
grin all the way?

08:57.910 --> 08:59.390
Didn't Master ask us to buy

08:59.870 --> 09:01.150
herbs for the detoxifying bath?

09:01.370 --> 09:02.690
I'm just happy that I can go down the mountain,

09:02.720 --> 09:03.840
stroll around the fair, and enjoy good food.

09:05.020 --> 09:05.930
But why do I feel like

09:05.960 --> 09:06.880
you said "Master"

09:06.910 --> 09:07.600
so affectionately?

09:08.000 --> 09:08.870
Yet you don't admit it.

09:09.750 --> 09:10.910
Whatever you say.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.200
I can't hide anything from you anyway.

09:13.490 --> 09:14.210
Then does Master know

09:14.240 --> 09:15.470
about your feelings?

09:17.030 --> 09:18.120
Well, how should I put it?

09:18.480 --> 09:20.030
I don't know if Master knows or not,

09:20.480 --> 09:21.480
but Mr. Zeng

09:21.510 --> 09:22.360
secretly warned me that

09:22.640 --> 09:23.490
coveting Masters

09:23.600 --> 09:24.750
would bring about divine retribution.

09:28.600 --> 09:29.000
Senior!

09:29.750 --> 09:30.480
Here we are, the pharmacy!

09:31.710 --> 09:32.990
[Herb Pharmacy]

09:37.320 --> 09:37.960
Senior Bai,

09:38.150 --> 09:39.120
what are you looking for?

09:40.550 --> 09:41.150
Nothing.

09:42.360 --> 09:43.720
You guys go inside and buy the medicine.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.630
I'll go browse around up ahead.

09:48.390 --> 09:48.980
Xi'er,

09:49.450 --> 09:50.760
don't you think Senior Bai's been acting weird

09:50.790 --> 09:51.630
these past few days?

09:52.000 --> 09:53.000
He's been sneaking down the mountain

09:53.030 --> 09:54.000
for something we don't know.

09:54.840 --> 09:55.870
You're right...

09:56.750 --> 09:57.660
Here's the shopping list.

09:57.790 --> 09:58.940
You and Senior Gao go buy the items.

09:59.000 --> 10:00.150
I'll go keep an eye on Senior Bai.

10:00.630 --> 10:00.910
Okay.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.440
Be careful.

10:03.910 --> 10:04.540
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

10:18.910 --> 10:19.390
Rou'er,

10:20.200 --> 10:21.030
I've missed you so much

10:21.630 --> 10:22.670
since we last met two days ago.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.320
I've been wanting to see you all this time.

10:31.550 --> 10:32.320
Let me see

10:32.900 --> 10:34.650
if your pretty face

10:35.150 --> 10:36.480
is messed up from crying.

10:38.960 --> 10:39.480
Bo,

10:40.320 --> 10:41.320
I can't even sleep well

10:41.600 --> 10:43.200
without you around.

10:44.200 --> 10:44.840
I've got

10:44.870 --> 10:46.190
your bath ready.

10:46.720 --> 10:47.480
Go ahead.

10:50.120 --> 10:50.790
You just can't wait.

10:51.630 --> 10:52.150
Bo,

10:52.840 --> 10:53.320
go ahead.

10:53.550 --> 10:54.320
Go quickly, Bo.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.200
Elder Tu,

11:00.360 --> 11:01.480
can you please find a woman

11:01.510 --> 11:02.960
to do the job of seducing this man?

11:03.200 --> 11:04.390
This guy's always getting handsy.

11:04.510 --> 11:05.510
I really want to split him in half.

11:07.510 --> 11:09.000
I'm the only woman among those who came out

11:09.320 --> 11:10.550
with the Lord this time.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.440
If you don't do it,

11:12.980 --> 11:13.690
are you suggesting that

11:13.720 --> 11:14.870
I should go deal with this fool?

11:15.550 --> 11:16.200
No, my lady.

11:16.910 --> 11:18.080
He's under the Illusion Spell.

11:18.510 --> 11:19.840
Just a trigger of words,

11:20.030 --> 11:21.030
and he'll see illusions

11:21.030 --> 11:21.840
and hear unreal sounds.

11:22.570 --> 11:24.300
I will tell the Lord about the information

11:24.590 --> 11:25.830
you got from him by it.

11:26.390 --> 11:28.120
And you'll get the credit for this one.

11:28.590 --> 11:29.920
What's the big deal if he gropes you?

11:31.630 --> 11:32.320
For the Lord,

11:32.670 --> 11:33.740
I'm willing to do anything

11:33.840 --> 11:34.500
at any cost!

11:35.120 --> 11:36.870
The Scarlet Sect is targeting Master.

11:38.030 --> 11:39.360
What exactly have they found out?

11:39.600 --> 11:40.440
And what's their plan?

11:48.630 --> 11:49.630
Senior Gao, Xi'er,

11:49.790 --> 11:50.840
hurry and come to this talisman's location.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.270
Senior Bai is here.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.750
Keep a close eye, but don't act rashly.

12:06.270 --> 12:07.240
Focus and Eavesdrop.

12:08.150 --> 12:09.600
I just suppressed the Resentment Liquid for her.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.360
She's circulating Qi to recover.

12:12.150 --> 12:13.320
Just keep it down.

12:13.670 --> 12:14.120
Who

12:15.200 --> 12:15.750
is he?

12:16.070 --> 12:17.360
Su Yishui is indeed very cautious.

12:17.710 --> 12:18.480
Bai Baishan

12:18.510 --> 12:19.910
has never heard him mention the Spirit Spring.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.200
All we know is that

12:21.200 --> 12:22.320
he's heading south the day after tomorrow.

12:22.960 --> 12:23.550
I guess

12:23.720 --> 12:25.440
they're heading for the Spirit Spring.

12:26.530 --> 12:27.690
I've already had Bai Baishan

12:27.720 --> 12:28.630
infected with the Horned Ghost Poison.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.670
Just a touch, and he can make Su Yishui

12:31.440 --> 12:32.470
fall victim to it

12:32.470 --> 12:33.390
without even realizing it.

12:34.030 --> 12:34.750
In that case,

12:34.970 --> 12:35.970
he'll be no match for you, My Lord,

12:36.200 --> 12:37.080
and will be at your mercy.

12:37.910 --> 12:38.630
Well done.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.360
What about the other fruit?

12:41.720 --> 12:42.790
Bai Baishan doesn't know,

12:43.390 --> 12:44.090
but he said

12:44.120 --> 12:46.120
Su Yishui values his Junior Xue the most.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.150
And that girl always has a branch

12:48.390 --> 12:50.030
hanging on her, like it's her precious treasure.

12:50.930 --> 12:53.130
Could she be the other fruit?

13:02.200 --> 13:02.940
Little girl,

13:03.200 --> 13:03.830
it's you!

13:04.480 --> 13:05.390
You're the little disciple

13:05.600 --> 13:06.960
Su Yishui values the most?

13:08.510 --> 13:09.240
What's your name?

13:10.030 --> 13:11.270
My master says, when we are out,

13:11.670 --> 13:12.120
we shouldn't

13:12.150 --> 13:13.360
tell strangers our names.

13:13.790 --> 13:14.360
Sir, I dare not

13:14.390 --> 13:15.320
disobey my master's order.

13:15.660 --> 13:17.150
He's got sharp ears

13:17.780 --> 13:18.940
and can hear us

13:19.190 --> 13:20.830
even from outside.

13:32.870 --> 13:33.600
Where is your master?

13:34.180 --> 13:35.540
He's been waiting outside.

13:36.120 --> 13:37.240
He asked me to invite you, Immortal Master Wei,

13:37.270 --> 13:38.000
out to meet him.

13:38.720 --> 13:39.380
My master said

13:39.530 --> 13:40.490
if there's anything you want to know,

13:40.750 --> 13:41.670
you can ask him directly.

13:41.870 --> 13:43.030
Don't bother going to such lengths.

13:44.480 --> 13:45.080
Go check it out.

13:46.150 --> 13:46.600
Got it.

13:49.520 --> 13:50.080
My Lord!

13:51.870 --> 13:52.440
Go after her! Now!

13:52.900 --> 13:54.090
But Su Yishui is also here.

13:54.490 --> 13:55.170
You're even dumber

13:55.200 --> 13:56.200
than a little girl!

13:56.510 --> 13:57.630
If her master were really here,

13:58.000 --> 13:58.480
would she have to

13:58.480 --> 13:59.350
flee away so fast?

13:59.630 --> 14:00.270
Go and get her!

14:00.580 --> 14:01.950
She might be the other fruit.

14:03.320 --> 14:03.750
Yes, My Lord.

14:11.910 --> 14:12.550
Wei Jiu is here.

14:12.910 --> 14:13.880
We can't touch Senior Bai for now.

14:13.910 --> 14:14.320
Let's run.

14:14.660 --> 14:14.970
Okay.

14:46.120 --> 14:46.480
Let's go!

14:47.790 --> 14:48.360
Ranran.

14:49.240 --> 14:49.750
Junior Xue,

14:50.030 --> 14:50.670
let's get out of here.

14:52.670 --> 14:53.550
We can't...

15:05.330 --> 15:07.200
My whip loves blood the most.

15:08.030 --> 15:09.440
Once it smells the scent of blood,

15:10.040 --> 15:11.130
I just can't hold it back.

15:13.270 --> 15:13.840
Move!

15:20.320 --> 15:21.060
Use the Exorcising Formation!

15:21.090 --> 15:21.540
Okay!

15:28.080 --> 15:29.150
Just a fragile formation.

15:38.310 --> 15:38.960
One wisp of qi...

15:42.560 --> 15:43.270
It's her!

15:48.680 --> 15:49.560
To break the galaxy!

15:53.120 --> 15:54.020
Mu Qingge...

15:57.440 --> 15:59.240
I won't let you steal my power again!

16:04.720 --> 16:06.150
Thought you really had something up your sleeve.

16:07.720 --> 16:08.770
Go to hell!

16:11.270 --> 16:11.840
Ranran!

16:22.750 --> 16:23.670
Master...

16:24.600 --> 16:26.240
Senior Bai is in the courtyard of Huaihua Lane.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.910
Wei Jiu has poisoned him

16:27.910 --> 16:28.510
to harm you.

16:29.260 --> 16:29.930
You must be careful.

16:29.960 --> 16:30.400
Silence.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.010
Let me help you recover and ease the pain.

17:26.310 --> 17:27.920
How dare you hurt my disciple?

17:29.030 --> 17:29.510
Retreat!

17:29.960 --> 17:30.720
You ask for it...

18:11.550 --> 18:13.240
Xue Ranran is Mu Qingge?

18:14.350 --> 18:15.070
Su Yishui,

18:16.400 --> 18:17.720
you've been fooling me all along.

18:19.630 --> 18:20.280
Both of you

18:21.350 --> 18:22.200
deserve to die.

18:38.070 --> 18:38.510
Feng!

18:39.240 --> 18:39.720
Feng!

18:42.240 --> 18:42.880
Your Highness.

18:46.440 --> 18:48.310
That beast is running wild again?

18:49.510 --> 18:50.320
You go back to the palace now

18:50.920 --> 18:51.490
to keep an eye on it.

18:53.000 --> 18:54.620
Once we restore the Four-Way Waterways,

18:56.400 --> 18:57.110
everything will be fine.

18:59.350 --> 18:59.830
Yes, Your Highness.

19:08.680 --> 19:09.200
Your Highness,

19:09.720 --> 19:11.110
among the squads sent to investigate the waterways,

19:11.560 --> 19:12.690
only those heading to the Puxin Village

19:12.720 --> 19:13.680
have not returned yet.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.000
There's no news from them either.

19:17.200 --> 19:18.830
No collapses in other areas.

19:19.790 --> 19:21.550
Then the Puxin Village must have undergone a collapse,

19:22.480 --> 19:23.240
blocking the waterway.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.240
Can't wait any longer.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.810
Tell everyone to gear up

19:27.270 --> 19:28.350
and set off for the Puxin Village right away.

19:28.720 --> 19:29.110
Understood!

19:36.070 --> 19:37.110
Why are you not after her?

19:37.960 --> 19:38.790
It's my fault, Your Highness.

19:39.510 --> 19:40.160
I followed Master Mu

19:40.160 --> 19:41.340
and saw her secretly meet Scarlet Sect's Wei Jiu.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.060
Then I just lost track of Master Mu.

19:45.030 --> 19:46.680
Qingge hates people like Wei Jiu.

19:47.070 --> 19:48.160
How could she meet him in secret?

19:51.720 --> 19:52.240
Something's off.

19:53.510 --> 19:54.790
No matter how much people change,

19:56.030 --> 19:57.060
their true nature hardly alters.

19:58.270 --> 19:59.680
Qingge has always been upfront.

20:00.790 --> 20:01.440
Her ditching you

20:01.440 --> 20:02.720
is already the biggest red flag.

20:07.350 --> 20:09.000
She can't be Qingge.

20:19.480 --> 20:19.960
Ranran...

20:26.000 --> 20:26.720
Holy moly,

20:26.720 --> 20:27.680
you're finally awake.

20:28.310 --> 20:28.750
You've been

20:28.780 --> 20:30.060
asleep for four days, you know?

20:30.160 --> 20:31.400
Everything's in chaos out there.

20:32.470 --> 20:33.030
What?

20:33.790 --> 20:35.000
I thought with Master here,

20:35.020 --> 20:35.950
everything must be fine then.

20:36.310 --> 20:36.830
Could it be

20:37.160 --> 20:38.640
that Wei Jiu really injured Master?

20:38.930 --> 20:39.650
Then Master...

20:39.680 --> 20:40.310
That's not the case.

20:40.750 --> 20:41.390
Calm down.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.280
Don't let your wounds

20:42.310 --> 20:42.880
split open.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.440
You should have seen it.

20:45.510 --> 20:46.960
Master was terrifying that day.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.750
He went on a killing spree all the way.

20:49.310 --> 20:50.070
Those Scarlets

20:50.270 --> 20:51.680
were burned to ashes right before us.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.070
Not even a trace was left.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.000
Master held you like this

20:55.830 --> 20:56.310
and said,

20:56.880 --> 20:58.000
"How dare you hurt my disciple?

20:58.480 --> 20:59.310
You ask for it."

21:00.880 --> 21:01.480
He held me?

21:03.510 --> 21:05.000
Did he hold me all the way and bring me back?

21:05.310 --> 21:06.680
What are you secretly thinking about?

21:07.400 --> 21:08.680
Oh, God. You look so lost

21:08.680 --> 21:09.440
in love.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.550
But don't get in too deep

21:13.510 --> 21:15.200
How can I control it?

21:15.750 --> 21:16.920
Master is so nice.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.790
Senior Bai won't agree with you.

21:21.030 --> 21:22.030
Senior Bai is about to be expelled

21:22.240 --> 21:23.350
from the sect by Master, you know?

21:24.270 --> 21:25.920
The Horned Ghost Poison in you has been removed,

21:26.590 --> 21:27.440
but it's diminished

21:27.440 --> 21:28.440
your cultivation

21:28.960 --> 21:29.680
in an irreversible way.

21:30.550 --> 21:31.640
Our master-disciple tie ends here.

21:32.430 --> 21:33.160
You may leave now.

21:33.750 --> 21:34.240
Master...

21:35.680 --> 21:37.040
I-I didn't mean to do it.

21:37.450 --> 21:38.560
I've always looked up to you, Master.

21:38.590 --> 21:39.960
I would never dare to betray you.

21:41.400 --> 21:41.960
Master,

21:42.590 --> 21:44.310
I-I don't want to be a good-for-nothing.

21:44.720 --> 21:45.720
As omnipotent as you are,

21:45.750 --> 21:47.240
you must have some way to help me.

21:47.830 --> 21:48.480
Your Bai family

21:48.480 --> 21:50.030
once saved a veteran Wester.

21:50.790 --> 21:51.680
Out of gratitude for this favor,

21:51.680 --> 21:52.590
I took you as my disciple.

21:53.070 --> 21:54.550
But this time, you were blinded by lust,

21:54.720 --> 21:56.110
causing your fellows to face danger and get hurt.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.550
You should've paid for your sins with your life.

21:58.240 --> 21:59.790
Expelling you from the sect

21:59.790 --> 22:00.550
is me showing mercy.

22:01.510 --> 22:02.320
I've said all I need to say.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.070
That's enough.

22:04.790 --> 22:05.310
Master...

22:05.550 --> 22:06.070
Master!

22:06.510 --> 22:07.200
Master!

22:17.000 --> 22:17.880
Is it that serious?

22:20.030 --> 22:21.510
Both Senior Gao and I were reluctant to see that happen.

22:21.590 --> 22:22.920
We wanted to plead with Master.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.940
But Master only called Mr. Yu Chen

22:24.960 --> 22:26.040
and Mr. Zeng Yi here

22:26.070 --> 22:26.750
to take care of you.

22:27.240 --> 22:28.480
Then he just went into seclusion, not seeing anyone.

22:29.680 --> 22:31.160
Why did Master suddenly go into seclusion?

22:40.400 --> 22:41.920
Su Yishui, look at yourself.

22:42.720 --> 22:43.720
Given the way you lost control with rage,

22:43.720 --> 22:44.640
you just don't look like a sovereign.

22:45.640 --> 22:46.640
Aren't you afraid of frightening Ranran?

22:47.830 --> 22:48.920
If I didn't already know the Spirit Spring

22:48.920 --> 22:49.550
had been taken away,

22:50.030 --> 22:51.350
I would've thought you were repeating the same mistake.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.720
What's going on?

23:04.640 --> 23:05.850
Why can't I suppress this bloodlust?

23:17.160 --> 23:18.160
Only the Demon's child

23:18.500 --> 23:19.500
can summon it.

23:19.960 --> 23:20.550
And you

23:21.370 --> 23:22.850
are the perfect, one-in-a-million

23:22.880 --> 23:24.000
choice for the Demon's child.

23:24.790 --> 23:25.920
I have put this Spirit Spring

23:25.920 --> 23:26.880
into your heart

23:27.550 --> 23:30.200
and sacrificed your body to the Spirit Spring.

23:36.110 --> 23:36.680
I thought

23:37.520 --> 23:38.890
it had all ended 19 years ago.

23:38.920 --> 23:39.550
Could it be that...

23:41.400 --> 23:42.400
The drop of Spirit Spring hasn't

23:42.400 --> 23:43.200
been removed from my heart?

23:43.790 --> 23:44.760
I got close to the Spirit Spring,

23:44.790 --> 23:45.720
so it was triggered again?

24:14.200 --> 24:15.070
Couldn't find it.

24:16.200 --> 24:17.400
Maybe it has hidden itself?

24:25.270 --> 24:25.920
Master,

24:26.590 --> 24:28.000
you've been in seclusion for days.

24:28.440 --> 24:29.680
Did you get injured?

24:44.510 --> 24:46.360
The Ice Lotus Technique can suppress the Spirit Spring.

24:46.400 --> 24:47.200
It's hard to detect it.

24:48.310 --> 24:49.400
Once I find the Spirit Spring,

24:49.960 --> 24:51.480
the drop in my heart, if still there,

24:51.750 --> 24:52.480
will surely respond.

24:53.270 --> 24:54.200
I will finally have an answer.

25:13.160 --> 25:13.830
Master?

25:17.890 --> 25:18.320
Master...

25:18.350 --> 25:18.920
Don't move.

25:19.510 --> 25:20.960
You haven't fully recovered. Why are you running around?

25:39.400 --> 25:41.440
A Demon's child will always be a Demon's child.

25:42.510 --> 25:44.750
He truly believes his fate has been changed?

25:45.550 --> 25:46.240
He's getting

25:46.270 --> 25:47.680
closer and closer to the Spirit Spring.

25:48.590 --> 25:49.870
Once he finds the Spirit Spring,

25:50.070 --> 25:52.000
it will repossess his body.

25:52.160 --> 25:52.920
And we

25:53.830 --> 25:56.260
will once again own the Demon's child.

26:02.440 --> 26:03.590
Thank you, guardian.

26:08.790 --> 26:09.790
The guardians have been

26:09.790 --> 26:11.030
healing you for the past few days.

26:11.550 --> 26:12.880
But why hasn't it worked?

26:13.270 --> 26:14.240
With my damaged Spirit Root,

26:14.590 --> 26:16.350
It'll take me some more time to heal completely.

26:17.110 --> 26:17.830
Tu Jiuyuan.

26:20.030 --> 26:20.510
My Lord.

26:22.880 --> 26:23.400
You may leave now.

26:23.510 --> 26:24.000
Yes, My Lord.

26:30.960 --> 26:32.200
Are you dead yet?

26:34.400 --> 26:35.070
My Lord.

26:36.110 --> 26:37.400
How useless you are.

26:38.030 --> 26:39.310
You couldn't even catch

26:39.310 --> 26:40.070
a little girl.

26:40.750 --> 26:42.310
And you got yourself injured like this.

26:42.680 --> 26:44.240
You've truly disgraced the Scarlet Sect.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.080
My bad, My Lord.

26:47.210 --> 26:47.890
I've been a bit better

26:47.950 --> 26:49.400
the past few days.

26:50.110 --> 26:51.350
I will capture that girl right away.

26:53.110 --> 26:54.200
Just lie there and recover.

26:57.590 --> 26:58.160
Yes.

26:58.960 --> 26:59.550
My Lord,

27:00.310 --> 27:01.350
I have one more thing to say.

27:03.310 --> 27:05.470
What you seek is the Spirit Spring.

27:06.070 --> 27:07.720
Constantly confronting Su Yishui head-on

27:07.880 --> 27:08.720
is unnecessary.

27:09.500 --> 27:11.320
Why not keep a close watch in secret?

27:11.750 --> 27:12.960
It's not too late to move after we learn

27:13.160 --> 27:14.160
where the Spirit Spring is.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.200
Tu Jiuyuan,

27:16.880 --> 27:17.680
remember this clearly.

27:18.440 --> 27:19.650
I am the sovereign.

27:20.140 --> 27:21.450
If you dare to cross the line again,

27:21.890 --> 27:23.280
I will show no mercy.

27:23.310 --> 27:23.750
Yes, My Lord.

27:59.070 --> 28:00.270
Senior, you like this?

28:01.550 --> 28:02.110
Fine.

28:02.550 --> 28:03.400
I'll be the Scarlet Sovereign

28:03.750 --> 28:04.510
and open Mount Red Flame.

28:05.000 --> 28:05.590
At that time,

28:06.110 --> 28:07.880
I'll make you the Sovereign of Butterfly Valley.

28:14.940 --> 28:15.850
How could I have

28:15.880 --> 28:17.200
such a useless son like you?

28:18.360 --> 28:20.120
You've lost to your Senior ten times in a row!

28:20.720 --> 28:21.680
How can our Scarlet Sect's future

28:22.030 --> 28:24.270
be entrusted to a good-for-nothing like you?

28:27.680 --> 28:28.480
Fortunately,

28:29.590 --> 28:31.640
I still have an excellent disciple like Jiuyuan.

28:38.130 --> 28:38.650
Jiuyuan,

28:39.680 --> 28:40.200
come here.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.960
This is half of the Scarlet Sect Token.

28:50.550 --> 28:51.480
From today on,

28:52.000 --> 28:54.550
you are the Token-holding Elder of the Scarlet Sect.

28:57.070 --> 28:58.160
When I'm away,

28:58.310 --> 28:59.110
all sect matters

28:59.480 --> 29:00.880
will be under your management.

29:06.110 --> 29:08.600
-Greetings, Elder Tu!
-Greetings, Elder Tu!

29:18.000 --> 29:18.680
Take it.

29:28.200 --> 29:28.790
I

29:29.420 --> 29:30.790
will not disappoint you, Sovereign.

29:44.270 --> 29:45.400
Remember what I've told you.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.070
Your responsibility

29:47.440 --> 29:49.070
is to become his rival.

29:49.420 --> 29:50.800
You must constantly challenge him,

29:50.830 --> 29:51.640
train him,

29:52.000 --> 29:54.480
to wear away his arrogance and recklessness.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.270
You must always remind him

29:56.550 --> 29:57.640
not to slack off.

30:00.960 --> 30:01.480
Yes, Master.

30:03.350 --> 30:05.510
The Scarlet Sect will eventually be handed over to you guys.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.110
In the future,

30:06.640 --> 30:08.000
with the Scarlet Sect Token,

30:09.200 --> 30:11.480
you must keep a close eye on your junior

30:11.960 --> 30:15.200
and guide him properly.

30:46.110 --> 30:46.830
Sovereign is away.

30:47.320 --> 30:47.970
I've already asked

30:48.000 --> 30:49.070
the guards to leave.

30:49.210 --> 30:50.360
Your punishment can end here.

30:50.380 --> 30:50.990
Get up now.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.640
How powerful you are, Elder Tu.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.480
You've got wounds all over.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.440
Apply some medicine first.

31:15.440 --> 31:16.510
Stop pretending to care about me!

31:18.480 --> 31:20.240
You want more than just the Scarlet Sect Token,

31:20.790 --> 31:21.680
so you keep going against me

31:21.700 --> 31:22.900
and fighting me for merits.

31:25.270 --> 31:26.000
Just you wait.

31:32.920 --> 31:34.880
You and I are drifting further apart

31:37.210 --> 31:38.160
and can never go back, huh?

31:52.130 --> 31:53.930
Senior Bai seems to have been kneeling all this time.

31:54.370 --> 31:55.460
You want to plead for him?

31:57.880 --> 31:59.350
My pleading wouldn't make a difference.

31:59.750 --> 32:00.920
You've made up your mind.

32:01.960 --> 32:02.600
Besides,

32:03.270 --> 32:04.680
Senior Bai did make a mistake.

32:05.110 --> 32:05.790
You asked us

32:05.790 --> 32:07.720
to copy the Tranquility Spell for detoxification,

32:08.170 --> 32:09.370
yet he slacked off

32:09.400 --> 32:10.550
and let the Scarlet Sect take advantage.

32:10.960 --> 32:12.480
So you don't want to teach him anymore.

32:12.880 --> 32:14.350
I won't put you in a tough spot, Master.

32:15.680 --> 32:17.160
You always see through things better than others.

32:17.830 --> 32:18.810
No punishment for minor evils

32:18.920 --> 32:19.830
will surely beget bigger ones.

32:20.240 --> 32:21.310
The immortal cultivation

32:21.590 --> 32:22.350
already grants people

32:22.350 --> 32:23.910
abilities beyond the norm.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.680
If one grows to be a villain,

32:26.000 --> 32:27.270
wouldn't that cause tremendous harm?

32:34.030 --> 32:34.960
However...

32:36.480 --> 32:37.920
While Senior Bai is certainly at fault,

32:38.510 --> 32:40.550
you're also responsible for it, Master.

32:42.550 --> 32:43.270
How?

32:44.000 --> 32:45.470
We disciples are still young

32:45.550 --> 32:46.400
and without well-developed values.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.680
Good and evil are just a matter of a single thought.

32:49.510 --> 32:50.310
Yet Master,

32:50.510 --> 32:51.990
you're only strict in teaching martial arts,

32:52.360 --> 32:53.210
but you've never

32:53.240 --> 32:54.550
really talked to us about what can be done

32:54.990 --> 32:56.620
and what cannot on the path of cultivation.

32:57.640 --> 32:58.160
So,

32:59.000 --> 33:00.310
I haven't fulfilled my duties as a master?

33:02.350 --> 33:03.030
I wouldn't dare say that.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.960
You have your own reasons for doing anything.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.240
I'm human too.

33:06.880 --> 33:07.960
Why can't I make mistakes?

33:10.200 --> 33:11.030
If one day

33:12.000 --> 33:12.800
you find out that I am

33:12.830 --> 33:13.790
an unforgivable villain,

33:16.480 --> 33:17.200
what would you do?

33:19.550 --> 33:20.680
How could you be that?

33:25.880 --> 33:26.640
Even in that case,

33:27.350 --> 33:27.920
you

33:28.400 --> 33:29.240
must have your reasons,

33:29.240 --> 33:30.400
something you can't avoid.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.680
I'm willing to stay by your side,

33:33.030 --> 33:35.440
sharing weal and woe, facing everything together.

33:36.160 --> 33:37.400
No one wants you to do that for me!

33:38.000 --> 33:39.160
Just take care of yourself.

33:44.030 --> 33:45.000
This is a Qi-Nourishing Pill.

33:45.880 --> 33:46.830
It's good for your recovery.

33:47.510 --> 33:48.070
Just take it.

34:00.030 --> 34:01.350
Help, Master.

34:04.210 --> 34:05.690
The Qi-Nourishing Pill you make

34:05.720 --> 34:06.640
is incredibly bitter.

34:07.070 --> 34:07.920
I need to eat it

34:08.190 --> 34:09.630
with the candied fruits I made myself.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.409
They're in the drawer of that cabinet.

34:16.960 --> 34:17.710
Now you know

34:17.710 --> 34:18.760
to call out for my help?

34:44.760 --> 34:45.670
Is it really that bitter?

34:57.760 --> 34:58.480
Stop it.

35:00.330 --> 35:02.200
Actually, I've noticed you like sweet food

35:02.400 --> 35:03.400
since long ago,

35:03.880 --> 35:04.670
and I've

35:04.670 --> 35:06.360
corrected it in the "Collection of Entertainment."

35:07.000 --> 35:07.550
In the future,

35:08.180 --> 35:09.750
I will get to know you better

35:10.590 --> 35:11.440
and update the Collection

35:12.230 --> 35:13.500
bit by bit.

35:14.070 --> 35:14.800
Master,

35:15.550 --> 35:16.590
actually,

35:16.960 --> 35:18.700
I don't know if you've

35:18.920 --> 35:20.070
already noticed

35:20.480 --> 35:20.920
that I...

35:30.600 --> 35:31.650
I have another gift for you.

35:32.630 --> 35:33.000
Okay.

35:33.630 --> 35:34.550
Then I'll accept it.

35:47.920 --> 35:48.590
Get some rest.

35:50.400 --> 35:51.160
Master.

35:53.510 --> 35:55.190
I haven't finished yet.

35:56.960 --> 35:57.590
Master...

36:01.000 --> 36:02.030
I realize my mistake.

36:02.550 --> 36:04.070
Please don't send me away.

36:05.440 --> 36:06.840
While Senior Bai is certainly at fault,

36:07.310 --> 36:09.510
you're also responsible for it, Master.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.480
Is it that

36:11.480 --> 36:12.440
your talent is exceptional,

36:13.110 --> 36:14.550
so you don't want to be bound by any restrictions?

36:15.070 --> 36:16.510
You think you can control everything.

36:16.960 --> 36:17.440
But you don't realize that

36:17.440 --> 36:19.230
arrogance without self-restraint

36:19.230 --> 36:19.920
is a real danger.

36:20.630 --> 36:21.720
I realize my mistake, Master.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.510
I will definitely make a change.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.320
If you truly want to repent,

36:28.030 --> 36:28.840
from today on,

36:29.110 --> 36:30.070
bind one of your arms

36:30.340 --> 36:31.250
and follow Zeng Yi

36:31.280 --> 36:32.230
to learn artifact forging

36:32.960 --> 36:34.320
as well as the way of self-restraint.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.630
When you can assemble

36:35.630 --> 36:36.630
a self-striking clock with one hand,

36:37.040 --> 36:37.970
I will take back my words

36:38.000 --> 36:39.280
and let you return as a Wester.

36:39.840 --> 36:40.280
No

36:40.280 --> 36:41.550
second chance if you can't do it.

36:42.510 --> 36:43.070
I

36:44.360 --> 36:45.190
will definitely nail it.

36:47.630 --> 36:48.190
Stand up.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.190
Thank you, Master.

37:08.000 --> 37:09.760
Master used to be so kind-hearted.

37:10.720 --> 37:11.560
After punishment,

37:11.590 --> 37:12.580
she always forgave her disciples

37:12.630 --> 37:13.440
who made mistakes.

37:15.450 --> 37:15.970
But you, Su Yishui,

37:16.000 --> 37:16.840
are never that kind of person.

37:17.320 --> 37:17.740
How come?

37:18.760 --> 37:19.670
Of course I'm not.

37:20.710 --> 37:22.150
That's why I disappointed her again and again.

37:24.070 --> 37:25.440
He's just like me back then.

37:26.360 --> 37:27.280
These unruly disciples

37:28.230 --> 37:29.570
made me realize a master's hardships.

37:31.590 --> 37:32.320
Ranran was right.

37:33.400 --> 37:34.920
I wasn't attentive enough when teaching disciples before,

37:35.930 --> 37:36.770
causing myself

37:36.800 --> 37:38.000
some inevitable trouble.

37:39.550 --> 37:41.110
The Mistaken Divine brewed by Ranran.

37:41.790 --> 37:42.580
Liang Wumeng gave this to me.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.000
I think

37:44.070 --> 37:45.880
you've been really stressed out lately

37:46.230 --> 37:47.440
because of Ranran's injury.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.000
Now that Ranran is awake,

37:49.320 --> 37:50.110
you can relax, right?

37:54.190 --> 37:54.840
Take it.

37:56.920 --> 37:57.670
You know,

37:58.110 --> 37:59.190
you keep your worries too deep inside.

37:59.480 --> 38:00.550
Don't push yourself too hard.

38:01.110 --> 38:02.400
You should chill occasionally.

38:11.110 --> 38:12.480
Ranran! Ranran!

38:13.360 --> 38:13.800
Ranran,

38:14.110 --> 38:15.230
Master showed mercy!

38:15.550 --> 38:16.840
Senior Bai has a chance to return.

38:17.880 --> 38:18.840
This is unprecedented.

38:19.550 --> 38:20.600
That's great!

38:22.950 --> 38:24.390
What method did you use

38:24.440 --> 38:25.480
to make Master change his mind?

38:27.190 --> 38:27.880
I just

38:28.110 --> 38:29.800
said what was on my mind.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.280
What matters is that

38:31.490 --> 38:32.720
Master was willing to take my advice.

38:34.740 --> 38:35.750
You make it sound so easy.

38:36.060 --> 38:37.710
Senior Gao and I also pleaded with Master, but it didn't work.

38:40.110 --> 38:41.360
Seems like Master really

38:41.630 --> 38:42.670
treats you differently.

38:45.720 --> 38:46.950
Differently?

38:47.440 --> 38:48.960
Do you also feel that

38:48.960 --> 38:50.070
Master has...

38:51.400 --> 38:52.000
Well,

38:52.960 --> 38:53.710
Could it be...

38:54.510 --> 38:55.320
Does he have...

38:57.810 --> 38:58.890
Look at your stutter

38:58.920 --> 38:59.800
and the romantic vibe.

39:00.070 --> 39:01.550
I can't take it anymore.

39:03.940 --> 39:05.260
You just want to ask

39:05.630 --> 39:07.230
if Master has feelings for you too, right?

39:09.000 --> 39:09.710
Well,

39:10.550 --> 39:11.800
only Master himself knows the answer.

39:13.230 --> 39:13.690
Oh, God.

39:14.030 --> 39:14.840
I can't wait anymore.

39:15.230 --> 39:16.630
I must ask for a clear answer right away.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.670
You're really going to do it?

39:20.030 --> 39:21.590
Have you forgotten what Mr. Zeng said?

39:22.070 --> 39:22.960
Coveting one's own master

39:23.400 --> 39:24.670
will bring about divine retribution.

39:26.000 --> 39:26.510
Well...

39:27.590 --> 39:28.480
So what?

39:29.440 --> 39:30.710
I'm a fruit anyway,

39:30.800 --> 39:31.900
I'm not bound by human rules.

39:32.190 --> 39:32.710
Lightning

39:32.840 --> 39:33.880
probably won't strike me, right?

39:49.590 --> 39:50.480
We'll set off tomorrow.

39:51.150 --> 39:52.150
The Spirit Spring is near.

39:53.710 --> 39:54.710
And now I actually feel timid.

39:56.800 --> 39:57.700
Freshly picked sweet fruit.

39:58.670 --> 39:59.480
From now on,

39:59.840 --> 40:01.110
we'll only taste sweetness, not bitterness.

40:03.190 --> 40:04.000
Qingge,

40:05.110 --> 40:06.220
If I were Grandmaster,

40:06.440 --> 40:08.000
of course I would think Young Master Yu is better

40:08.190 --> 40:09.220
and more likable.

40:29.630 --> 40:31.030
I fear that what I seek in this life

40:32.430 --> 40:33.710
is nothing but an illusion.

41:01.490 --> 41:02.560
So you came after all.

41:03.550 --> 41:05.230
How did you know I was coming, Master?

41:06.000 --> 41:06.760
Have you been

41:07.480 --> 41:08.510
waiting for me all along?

41:09.840 --> 41:11.230
I've waited for you for many years.

41:12.850 --> 41:13.620
I got you,

41:14.670 --> 41:15.880
yet it feels like I didn't.

41:16.620 --> 41:17.950
What do you mean, Master?

41:18.440 --> 41:19.510
I'm right here.

41:27.000 --> 41:27.510
Yes,

41:28.400 --> 41:29.360
you are here.

41:30.440 --> 41:31.150
That's good too.

41:35.030 --> 41:36.060
But someday,

41:36.290 --> 41:37.120
you will leave me.

41:37.440 --> 41:37.920
No.

41:40.360 --> 41:41.560
I don't want to leave you, Master.

41:42.100 --> 41:43.430
I did think about

41:43.880 --> 41:45.050
finishing my studies and leaving

41:45.670 --> 41:47.440
for the life I wanted.

41:48.440 --> 41:49.060
I wanted

41:49.800 --> 41:50.740
to have a home

41:51.760 --> 41:53.030
and have someone

41:53.110 --> 41:54.480
to keep me company for life.

41:55.230 --> 41:56.920
But after being with you for so long,

41:58.280 --> 41:59.400
with your teachings

41:59.880 --> 42:00.480
and protection,

42:02.230 --> 42:02.920
you've

42:03.760 --> 42:05.070
already been the closest person to me.

42:06.220 --> 42:07.140
And you've also become

42:08.190 --> 42:09.550
the one I want to be with the most.

42:14.480 --> 42:16.070
This is a new branch

42:16.630 --> 42:17.760
from my Reincarnation Tree

42:18.130 --> 42:19.690
that grew as my cultivation improved.

42:21.440 --> 42:22.440
You once said

42:22.920 --> 42:24.760
this tree's tied to my life.

42:25.230 --> 42:26.510
I've made it into a wooden hairpin

42:26.670 --> 42:27.630
as a gift for you.

42:28.710 --> 42:30.030
This wood is like my heart.

42:30.840 --> 42:32.160
Hope it can always

42:32.550 --> 42:33.960
be with you, Master.

42:43.550 --> 42:44.110
So,

42:45.190 --> 42:46.960
what do you think, Master?

42:49.360 --> 42:50.360
I have a gift for you too.

42:54.880 --> 42:56.030
I made this myself.

42:57.800 --> 42:58.400
It's for you.

43:01.150 --> 43:02.510
You used to be into such stuff.

43:04.800 --> 43:05.800
"Used to"?

43:06.710 --> 43:07.800
Master, you...
